{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"12234","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12234","key":"MC-160001","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"28/Aug/19 4:29 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>When punching or sprinting on certain blocks, no particles are given off, at least not until they actually break. This affects skulls, wall skulls (do these really need to still use a tile entity renderer?), banners, wall banners, signs and wall signs. Falling from a height into these blocks or successfully breaking them does produce particles as intended.</p>\n\n<p>It may also be worth noting that all head blocks are also subject to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"MC-1874\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-1874\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Breaking some blocks produces wrong particles\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-1874\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Open</span>\n            </span>\n when regrading falling particles.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"13/Sep/19 12:58 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/15589","id":"15589","filename":"2019-08-29_00.20.15.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.